("LLM inference","Intermediate",["Prefill processes prompt; decode generates tokens","TTFT is initial wait; ITL is spacing between later tokens","KV cache grows with context and concurrent requests"],"p95 TTFT, p95 ITL, output tokens/s","Response time ≈ TTFT + (output tokens−1) × ITL","Long prompt has slow TTFT: examine prefill and prefix cache.",[("Why p95?","Tail latency reveals slow user experiences."),("What competes for VRAM as concurrency rises?","KV cache and runtime allocations.")],["vLLM prefix cache","vLLM disaggregation"]),
